The nfs-devel@linux.kernel.org mailing list has been effectively
inactive for some months.  Only spam arrives.  When I post, I get
lots of bounces from addresses that are no-longer valid.
The active nfs list is currently nfs@lists.sourceforge.net.

Who do I talk to about getting the list destroyed?  or at least get my
name removed from it?

